{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19502","headline":"酬仆射牛相公晋国池上别後至甘棠馆忽梦同游因成口号见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬仆射牛相公晋国池上别後至甘棠馆忽梦同游因成口号见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已嗟池上别魂惊，忽报梦中携手行。\n此夜独归还乞梦，老人无睡到天明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}